Palmimo face display firmware

No firmware binary is included yet. Without firmware.json the updater returns
undeclared and leaves connected hardware alone.

Firmware binaries installed in /usr/local/lib/palmimo/display-firmware are
Jizai's copyrighted work and are excluded from this repository's license.
Their third-party notices and full license texts will be distributed in
/usr/share/doc/palmimo-display-firmware.
